{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1793163024586,"level":"log","data":["[DEBUG] AnnouncementCard keys:","{\"json\": \"{\\\"targetAudience\\\":{\\\"type\\\":\\\"All\\\",\\\"department\\\":null,\\\"role\\\":null},\\\"_id\\\":\\\"6adb4984e405c5674478df37\\\",\\\"title\\\":\\\"Subject: 🌼 Dasara Holiday Announcement 🎉\\\",\\\"description\\\":\\\"<p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">Hi&nbsp;Everyone,</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">🌼✨&nbsp;Wishing&nbsp;you&nbsp;all&nbsp;a&nbsp;very&nbsp;Happy&nbsp;Navaratri&nbsp;and&nbsp;Dasara!&nbsp;May&nbsp;this&nbsp;festive&nbsp;season&nbsp;bring&nbsp;happiness,&nbsp;prosperity,&nbsp;and&nbsp;success&nbsp;to&nbsp;you&nbsp;and&nbsp;your&nbsp;families.&nbsp;🌸🪔</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">We’re&nbsp;happy&nbsp;to&nbsp;announce&nbsp;that&nbsp;the&nbsp;Dasara&nbsp;holidays&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;from&nbsp;17th&nbsp;to&nbsp;21st&nbsp;October&nbsp;2026.&nbsp;🎉&nbsp;As&nbsp;many&nbsp;team&nbsp;members&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;travelling&nbsp;to&nbsp;their&nbsp;hometowns,&nbsp;19th&nbsp;October&nbsp;(Monday)&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;a&nbsp;holiday,&nbsp;and&nbsp;the&nbsp;working&nbsp;day&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;adjusted&nbsp;to&nbsp;Saturday,&nbsp;24th&nbsp;October&nbsp;2026.</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">Kindly&nbsp;note&nbsp;that&nbsp;&nbsp;attendance&nbsp;is&nbsp;mandatory&nbsp;on&nbsp;the&nbsp;remaining&nbsp;working&nbsp;days.&nbsp;Casual&nbsp;leave&nbsp;and&nbsp;work-from-home&nbsp;requests&nbsp;will&nbsp;not&nbsp;be&nbsp;&nbsp;entertained&nbsp;&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;any&nbsp;absence&nbsp;will&nbsp;be&nbsp;treated&nbsp;as&nbsp;Loss&nbsp;of&nbsp;Pay&nbsp;(LOP).</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">Plan&nbsp;your&nbsp;schedules&nbsp;accordingly&nbsp;and&nbsp;enjoy&nbsp;a&nbsp;wonderful&nbsp;festive&nbsp;break&nbsp;with&nbsp;your&nbsp;loved&nbsp;ones!&nbsp;❤️🌸</span></p><p></p><p><span style=\\\\\\\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: oklch(0.442 0.017 285.786);\\\\\\\">Wishing&nbsp;you&nbsp;all&nbsp;a&nbsp;joyful&nbsp;and&nbsp;memorable&nbsp;Dasara!&nbsp;🪔✨</span></p><p></p>\\\",\\\"category\\\":\\\"General\\\",\\\"priority\\\":\\\"Medium\\\",\\\"publishDate\\\":\\\"2026-10-22T18:30:00.000Z\\\",\\\"attachments\\\":[],\\\"company\\\":\\\"6abe2db0ae8c492f8ff37b32\\\",\\\"createdBy\\\":{\\\"_id\\\":\\\"6abe2db1ae8c492f8ff37b36\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Ashirbad\\\",\\\"displayName\\\":\\\"Ashirbad\\\",\\\"id\\\":\\\"6abe2db1ae8c492f8ff37b36\\\"},\\\"acknowledgments\\\":[],\\\"createdAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-23T11:48:20.314Z\\\",\\\"updatedAt\\\":\\\"2026-10-23T11:48:20.314Z\\\",\\\"__v\\\":0}\", \"keys\": [\"targetAudience\", \"_id\", \"title\", \"description\", \"category\", \"priority\", \"publishDate\", \"attachments\", \"company\", \"createdBy\", \"acknowledgments\", \"createdAt\", \"updatedAt\", \"__v\"], \"title\": \"Subject: 🌼 Dasara Holiday Announcement 🎉\"}"]}
